Third-party assets

This project is designed to use art assets from Freedoom, a free, drop-in,
Doom-compatible asset set — not the original DOOM game data, which is owned by
id Software / ZeniMax / Microsoft and is not freely licensed. Freedoom is
licensed under the BSD-3-Clause license.

    Freedoom — https://freedoom.github.io/
    Source   — https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom
    License  — BSD-3-Clause (https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/blob/master/COPYING.adoc)

When these assets are not present, the game renders with flat placeholder
colours, so no third-party assets are bundled with the source.
